---
import Platform from '../layouts/Platform.astro';
import CarouselReader from '../components/CarouselReader.astro';
import {foundingPass,readingPreview} from '../data/founding-pass.mjs';
import '../styles/founding-pass.css';
import '../styles/carousel-library.css';
---
<Platform title="Founding Member Pass" description="Full Digivated carousels, practical examples, and useful references. A $2 one-time founding offer is being prepared for the first 25 members.">
  <header class="page-intro founding-intro"><p class="eyebrow">The full idea, beyond the post</p><h1>Keep learning after the last slide.</h1><p class="lede">Digivated's X posts introduce the idea. The founding collection will take it further with full carousels, clear examples, and useful references you can come back to.</p><div class="founding-price"><strong>${foundingPass.priceUSD} USD</strong><span>One-time founding price · First {foundingPass.introductoryLimit} passes</span></div><p class="founding-launch-state"><span class="founding-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>In preparation. Sales aren't open yet.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="#reading-preview">Preview the reading experience</a><a class="button" href="https://x.com/digivatedx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read Digivated on X ↗</a></div><p class="quiet founding-price-note">The $2 launch offer will be limited to 25 purchases. Applicable taxes will be shown at checkout when sales open.</p></header>
  <section class="founding-section" aria-labelledby="pass-includes"><p class="eyebrow">A small collection, explained properly</p><h2 id="pass-includes">What the founding pass will cover</h2><div class="founding-benefits"><article><span class="founding-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>The complete carousels</h3><p>Follow the explanation beyond the public preview. Each carousel will have one clear objective and a sensible reading order.</p></article><article><span class="founding-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>Examples you can use</h3><p>See how the idea works in a realistic situation, with a practical next step that fits the topic.</p></article><article><span class="founding-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>References with a purpose</h3><p>Find sources and further reading, with enough context to understand why each link is useful.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="founding-section" id="reading-preview" aria-labelledby="reading-preview-title"><p class="eyebrow">Made for a phone. Comfortable to read.</p><h2 id="reading-preview-title">One idea at a time.</h2><p>Swipe through the cards, use the arrows, or open the text version below. You control the pace.</p><CarouselReader slides={readingPreview}/></section>
  <section class="founding-section founding-inventory" aria-labelledby="founding-collection-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">The founding collection</p><h2 id="founding-collection-title">See what's included before you buy.</h2><p>The launch collection is being prepared. Its carousel titles, topics, and included materials will be listed here before checkout opens.</p></div><div class="founding-inventory-state"><strong>Collection in preparation</strong><p id="founding-inventory-empty">There are no member carousels available yet.</p><ul id="founding-inventory-list" class="founding-inventory-list" hidden></ul><a href="/resources">Explore the available UI/UX packet →</a></div></section>
  <section class="founding-section founding-terms" aria-labelledby="founding-pass-terms"><h2 id="founding-pass-terms">One payment. A clearly defined collection.</h2><dl><div><dt>What you keep</dt><dd>Permanent access to the founding collection listed on this page when sales open. It isn't a monthly subscription, and there are no automatic renewals.</dd></div><div><dt>Later releases</dt><dd>Future collections aren't automatically included. Each new offer will explain its own contents and price.</dd></div><div><dt>The first 25 passes</dt><dd>The planned introductory price is $2 USD for the first 25 purchases. After that, the founding offer closes. A later offer may have a different price.</dd></div><div><dt>The UI/UX Prompt Packet</dt><dd>The $4 packet is a separate product. Buying the founding pass won't unlock the packet, and packet purchases won't unlock this collection.</dd></div></dl></section>

  <script>import '../scripts/carousel-reader.js';</script>
  <script>import '../scripts/carousel-library.js';</script>
</Platform>
